      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Adding the avatar reset button feels like putting a band aid on top of a security hole, I expected VRChat to fix this problem within days of it being abused but so far only modded clients were able to fix this issue and vanilla VRChat is still affected by this issue.",
