  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-02-11T14:30:38.349Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Just scrolling through the vrchat reddit, 1 out of 5 posts are about people being forced into crashing avatars making it so they can not load the game and just keep crashing. \nWe know you added a feature to the website to fix this, but 80% of the players do not know how to fix this. instead of adding a button on the website to fix this, it would be nice to not have this happen to being with, or atleast know you guys are aware of this issue and will try and fix it.",
